<title>JAPAN: Nippon Broadcasting - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Broadcasting - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    21.56		vs	   20.94</p>
<p> Operating	    1.58		vs	    1.41</p>
